RuinsOfAlph_Cave1_Text_CableClubReceptionist::
	.string "Welcome to this chamber.\p"
	.string "There are sliding panels that depict\n"
	.string "a POKéMON drawn by the ancients.\p"
	.string "Slide the panels around to form the\n"
	.string "picture.\p"
	.string "To the right is a description of the\n"
	.string "POKéMON.$"

RuinsOfAlph_Cave1_Text_Sign1::
	.string "A POKéMON that hid on the sea floor.\n"
	.string "Eyes on its back scanned the area.$"

RuinsOfAlph_Cave1_Text_Sign2_1::
	.string "...\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "{PLAYER} slided the panels.\n"
	.string "A picture of KABUTO was formed!$"

RuinsOfAlph_Cave1_Text_Sign2_2::
	.string "The RUINS are about 1500 years old.\p"
	.string "But it’s not known why they were\n"
	.string "built--or by whom.$"
